WEBVTT

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.820
Magami Academy

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.430
Nothing left behind here.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.070
How are you doing?

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.540
Just fine!

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.670
The place sure is empty now.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:19.970
Sure is...

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.940
Oh, where's Aoi, by the way?

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.820
I pray in the dark

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:49.620
Ima tsumetai kaze ni fukarete
Just now, as the cold breeze blew against me

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:58.080
Futo miushinatta jibun wo mita
I caught a sudden glimpse of a me that I'd lost

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:02.650
Iroasete kiete yuku
It's fading away

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:06.890
Kao no nai hitogomi no naka de
Vanishing in the faceless crowd

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:10.960
Utagoe wa todokanai
My singing voice won't get through

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.190
Kakikesarete shimau kara
It will be drowned out

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.760
Kotaete
Answer me

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.970
Inori wa hakanaku
My prayer is a fleeting wish

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.270
Kiekakesou na negai
That could vanish any moment

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:33.710
Itami wa kesenai kedo
I can't erase the pain

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:39.920
Kotoba de hikari wo atsumeru
But I gather up light with my words

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.220
Kanata e todoku you ni
So it will reach far, far away

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:50.860
Namida wa kesenai kedo
I can't erase the tears, but...

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:56.460
I pray in the dark

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:01.540
NOTICE:
Kyouichi Houraiji
Tatsuma Hiyu

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.010
Turn in your remedial
Bio 3 work today or
REPEAT THE YEAR.
Inugami

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.110
Are you kidding me?

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.320
Man, I don't believe friggin' Rabbit Man.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.120
It's not like the hypocrite's ever conducted
an honest to goodness class!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.660
Friends with that old bag lwayama, eh?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.660
Jeez!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.730
Isn't there anyone in this town who
takes anything seriously?

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.330
Certainly not as much as you.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.960
Huh?!

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.350
Huh? What's the matter?

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.340
Hiyums?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.360
Hey, Hiyums!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.700
Tatsuma?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.330
Hey!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.610
What's the matter?

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.740
Oh, nothing.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:16.400
Hey, how about we go for a breath of fresh air?

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.790
You know, we haven't done
a single thing here yet.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.580
Ah, shaddup!

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.660
All right, where to?

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.830
Oh, Romeo! Wherefore art th...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.290
No, no, no!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.260
That will not do at all!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.470
We don't deliver the lines like we're reading them!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.840
You do kind of sound like you're forcing the lines.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.500
You do not let the lines control you!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.870
You control the lines!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.840
R..Right...

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.410
Okay, take it from there.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.680
Go on!

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.680
Um, do you think you could do
that a little more calmly?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.250
What are you talking about?

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.180
We don't have time!

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.520
That's right!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:57.920
I'm afraid we'll need you to do as
we say this time around, 'kay?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.790
Oh, yes, of course...

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.290
Whassup?!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.630
Oh, Hiyu! Kyouichi!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.300
Hey, so how are the remedial studies going?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.930
We're just out for a breath of fresh air,
just some fresh air.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.700
But you only just started!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.700
Shut up!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.570
When the heck are you ever going to finish?

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.470
ROMEO & JULIET
Practice Schedule
When the heck are you ever going to finish?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.000
ROMEO & JULIET
Practice Schedule
So, was the graduation festival going to be
after the graduation ceremony then?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.510
Right! At our school,

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:23.210
there's always a students-only event that
follows the graduation ceremony.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.050
Jeez, the ceremony alone is
enough trouble already!

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:29.650
You were amazing last year, Aoi!

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:30.790
As Cinderella!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:35.560
Yeah! The special edition that had your
picture in it was crazy popular!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.660
Wow...

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:39.720
Um, everyone insisted, so...

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.470
Yeah, you were certainly great last year.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:46.440
However, this year I am the chair of
the executive committee.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.370
And I am the vice-chair!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:52.040
And so, this year's program will be
every bit as good, if not better!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.670
There!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.920
Adapted and directed by Kyoko Tohno?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:02.490
Well, naturally, I've adjusted it to my style.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.060
It is a great and moving masterwork,

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.790
filled with laughter, adventure and tears!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:10.330
I gave some ideas too!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.560
Romeo gets amnesia,

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.730
and falls in love with the woman who helps him!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:16.800
But in a shocking twist,

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.770
she turns out to be his long-lost sister!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.340
That was a wonderful idea!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.580
The middle section isn't slow anymore,
and all thanks to you!

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:29.050
No, it's because your script is so entertaining!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.020
Oh, no, no! You're too kind!

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:30.820
Oh, no, no! Not at all!
Oh, no, no! You're too kind!

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:34.650
Oh, no, no! Not at all!
No, no, no! Not at all, no!

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:37.120
I'm not as great as you are, Komaki!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:40.390
What's wrong?

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.630
It sounds like fun.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:42.790
Huh?!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.500
Oh, hey!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.290
You want to help out, Hiyu?

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.290
Huh?!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.670
Okay, we'll be counting on you!

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.710
You're a lifesaver!

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.610
Why don't you join him, Kyouichi?

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.140
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.440
Then, what'd you come here for?!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.520
It's peaceful, huh?

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.150
It's been ten days since the Martial Fist lncident,

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:11.190
and it's been totally quiet ever since.

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:12.560
I wish it could stay like this.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.350
No chance of that.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.030
I know that,

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.830
but still...

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:23.400
I wonder how they're all doing?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.800
Why are you following me?

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.990
No reason in particular.

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:43.180
The question is why are you
walking ahead of me?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.620
Do what you like.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.160
You're cute.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.870
Hey!

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.070
You touched her again?!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.370
No matter how many times we tell you,
you never learn!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:05.680
Even if it is you, Master Doshin,
enough is enough!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:09.250
And why is it always Hina, when I'm here too?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.350
Are you saying I'm not attractive?!

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:14.150
Big sister, that's beside the point...

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:21.290
What's the matter, Sagaya?

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.900
I smashed one of the medication
bottles and hurt my hand.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.920
Oh, no! Wait right there!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:29.790
N.. No need to get carried...

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.330
D..Does Maiko actually care
about me so deeply?!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:38.080
Is that it? Well, frankly I feel the same way, but...

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.040
Okay, lemme see your bum.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.750
Let's give you a little shot.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.420
It's gonna hurt really bad!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.980
D.. Don't!

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.790
Fish, fish, oh, fish!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.190
Yeah!

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.890
Sera?

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:09.740
Helping each other is the way to world peace!

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.910
Hey, whoa! I said cut it out!

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.180
You've got the wrong idea!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.710
They were just fans!

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.480
I wasn't...

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.850
I don't have anything to hide!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.650
Rai, baby, we love you!
This is one night we'll never forget!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.820
That's, uh...

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.250
JEALOUSY

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:31.930
Just you wait, Tatsuma!

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:35.160
I'm gonna become just the type of girl you like!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.240
Hiyu, take that end, will ya?

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.640
All right.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.150
No, that's not right!

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.780
More love!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.790
Gimme more of the love nectar!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.410
Nectar?

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.780
S..Sorry...

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.790
Look, look, look!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.030
It's totally gorgeous!

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.570
It's perfect!
It's totally gorgeous!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.270
That's Juliet's costume, right?

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.710
Yeah!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.670
She'll have to go try it on right away!

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.170
Ah, Juliet? Um, Juliet? Where are you?

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.720
Juliet went home.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.920
She said she had stuff to do this afternoon.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.220
WHAT?!

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.550
That hack actress!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.260
She can't even say her lines well enough yet!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.890
W..Well, it doesn't really have to be today...

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.130
Oh, Hiyu...

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.270
Think you'd mind trying this on,
if you've got the chance?

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.910
Anko?!

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.080
Yeah, sure thing.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.410
Oh, I get it, so they're getting a guy to play Juliet!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.780
A girl as Romeo and a guy as Juliet?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.320
Hey, that might be pretty cool!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.020
Ooh, that's hot!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.510
Oh, thank you!

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.930
Hey!

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:09.060
If Hiyu's gonna be Juliet,

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:12.600
I think Daigo would make a good Romeo!

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.330
Sa..Sakurai?

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.840
What are you talking about, Sakurai?!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.960
H..Have you lost your mind, Komaki?!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.880
Now, Komaki, there are some things
you should and shouldn't...

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.880
Hiyu and Daigo are a couple, huh?

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.310
That's a gas!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.380
No way!

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:30.180
A girl's going to play Romeo!

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.550
Why?!

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.820
C'mon, get dressed.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:33.920
Huh?

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:34.520
But l...

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.090
Let go of me!
But l...

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:35.620
Let go of me!
C'mon, put it on, put it on!

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:36.690
No, stop it, Anko!
C'mon, put it on, put it on!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.690
No, stop it, Anko!
But...

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:38.660
But a big, muscular Romeo would
be cool, dontcha' think?

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.760
Tatsuma, make a run for it, man!
But a big, muscular Romeo would
be cool, dontcha' think?

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:42.560
You think?

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.230
Wh..What do you think?

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.940
Uh, th..that works.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:52.940
D..Does it?

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:53.970
Right?
Does it now?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.480
Um, the costume looks like it's going to tear.
A Romeo who turns into a muscleman
when he drinks the potion...

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.410
This could work!

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.240
All right, I did it!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.180
What are you doing, man?!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.890
Hiyu seems to be having fun.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.890
Yeah...

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:14.490
He's always smiling, but this is the first
time I've seen him so upbeat.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:18.120
Yeah, there's still a lot of
mystery surrounding him.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.070
This place is boisterous as usual.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.310
No, it never changes,

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:33.580
neither the humans nor their world.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.710
They're just the same as they were back then.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.780
This is...

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.360
Tatsuma?!

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.750
Kureha?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.630
We've gotten a lot done.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.330
Not at all!

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.770
You sure?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:30.500
Well, I think we're quite a bit farther
ahead than planned though.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.940
What are you saying?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.010
The tough work is still ahead of us!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.910
There's the whole "future after graduation" thing!

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:37.510
Oh, I see.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:41.150
Everyone's going to be busy with exams
or looking for jobs, huh?

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.170
Well, I am confident about the
content of the play, at least.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:48.290
It will be all right, and we'll help out too.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.960
You better believe it!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.190
You're gonna put in some
good work too, aren't ya?

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.650
Yes'm...

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:59.130
This is the last project we'll all be
able to work on together.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.960
I want us to make some great memories, and...

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.760
It ain't over yet, after all.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.480
I see, yeah, that's true.

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:15.680
There's no need to worry.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:19.640
That's right! We've come this far working together!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.550
A lot has happened.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:27.020
It all started when Hiyu transferred to our school.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:30.820
We awakened to our powers,
fought the demons...

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:35.360
We had never imagined anything like that
would happen in our lives.

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.340
Of course not.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:43.070
I mean, I wasn't that serious at first.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.780
When you said you'd do it,

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.780
I kind of followed along like I had no choice.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.850
No, it was the same for me.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:51.550
The truth is I felt lost too.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.220
"Why me?" I thought.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:58.660
But now I'm glad that it was us.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.230
I was able to fight because
you were there, Komaki.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:09.430
And Kyouichi, and Daigo, and Kisaragi,
and Anko, and Hiyu...

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.900
I was able to fight because all of you were there.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:17.100
If it had been anyone else I was with,
then I doubt...

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:19.310
Yeah...

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.880
Misato...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:25.440
More of those "we had never imagined this"
things may happen to us.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.520
Yeah...

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.950
Things even tougher than what
we've been through so far.

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.160
But I want to live!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:39.200
No matter how hurt or battered I might become...

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:43.470
No matter how crazy or messed up
things might get...

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.300
I want to live through it, no matter what!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.110
I want you to live through it, no matter what.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.570
And I want us all to graduate together!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.780
Of course!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.740
After all, we're all gonna work together to make
the graduation festival a success!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:01.210
So, you get your remedial work done!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.090
Where did that come from?!

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.360
If you have to repeat,

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.880
then we can't all graduate together, can we?

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:11.130
It doesn't really matter to me
if I have to repeat or not.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.530
When you already hate school so much?

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.130
I'll just drop out if I feel like it.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.140
Forget it!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:20.400
If you like, we'll sit in on your studies with you.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.430
What?!

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:44.360
Let's make this culture festival fun!

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:58.540
By the way, where's Hiyu?

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.410
Dunno...

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.880
Maybe he's out buying some strawberry milk?

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.320
That Hiyu's one mysterious guy.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.810
That's the truth!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.620
I guess you could say he's one of those
people that there's a lot to.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.190
Naw, he's just a sleepyhead.

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.460
That is exactly what makes him the
Mysterious Transfer Student!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.190
We still have absolutely no idea
what he may be thinking.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.530
I'm telling ya all he thinks about is strawberries!

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.030
You might be right!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:34.940
But you know, it's all thanks to Hiyu that we're...

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:36.380
Yeah...

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:37.580
You're right.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.380
I guess...

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.450
Are you really sure about this?

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:44.260
Yeah, it's better if I go alone.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:46.660
I feel like she's calling out to me.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.370
Hello...

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:12.510
No, I'm not scared.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.250
Every now and then, since I was a child.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.790
Yes...

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.960
My mom and dad were there after all.

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:24.490
Plus, now I've got all the others with me.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.970
"Light?"

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:53.460
Hiyu!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.250
Are you okay?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.760
She was a kind person.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:08.170
I have heard that building has a connection
with Fuji and the Dragon Stream.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:13.010
That in order to seal away the gloom
escaping from that building,

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.410
the founders built this academy.

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.680
Dunno, I forget.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.350
Is something happening at Fuji?

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:25.850
Is the ghost of that woman a
previously cleansed demon's...

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.480
No...

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:34.530
Whew! Finished at last!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.730
How about we go get some ramen or something?

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:38.340
I'm for that!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.270
Let's eat!

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.070
I'm pretty hungry myself.

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:44.040
Okay, then that settles it!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.180
Huh?! Inugami!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:51.650
I finished all your worksheets, bastard!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.550
How ya like me now?!

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:57.520
You ain't got nowhere near what it takes
to make me repeat a year!

00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:00.390
After Misato gave you all the answers.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:02.020
Shaddup!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.920
Hiyu?

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:09.300
She said,

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.860
"I'm sorry. Thank you."

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:14.670
Did she?

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:16.640
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.180
Let's go!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.040
Let's go, Kisaragi.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:23.980
Hey, Kyouichi...

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.650
Huh?

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:26.420
Principal's Office

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.350
Principal's Office
Chiang Mai Province...

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:39.730
RAMEN

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.800
It is an honor to have been invited here.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.400
This place is deelish!

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.670
You're the one who invited,

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.640
so naturally you're paying, right?

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.810
As if!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:53.710
Tatsuma, why'd you go and suggest
we invite these guys anyway?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.110
I thought it might be fun if we all
went out together for once.

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.850
C'mon, Kyouichi, it's all right.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:19:59.150
We're all here now, so...

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:01.220
I'm going to order an extra helping.
Got a problem?

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.080
Sure, fine, jeez, do what you like.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:08.230
Tastes as good as ever!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:08.390
Totally delicious!
Tastes as good as ever!

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:11.130
Totally delicious!
Eating ramen makes me hungry
for something sweet.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.700
I could just keep on eating!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.030
Sakurai, were you always such a glutton?

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:21.510
That's right! I just can't forget
this place's pot stickers!

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.410
Is there someone there, Maiko?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.310
What a racket!
It's a neighborhood disturbance, it is!

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:28.910
Alan...

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:29.910
I got this.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.780
Oh, tres bien! What a splendid little present!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.020
Helping each other...

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:37.450
...is the way to world peace.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.180
Done!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.430
Image change complete!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.530
I've got everything set up for our
marriage registration.

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:51.660
Now, all that's left is for me to
leap into Tatsuma's arms!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:53.600
Just wait for me...

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.000
Tatsuma!

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.580
Where?

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:04.680
Where is he?

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:06.750
Don't be hasty, Kureha!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:08.550
Kureha!

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:10.720
What's the matter?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.600
Don't worry, I'm not going to die.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:30.170
Good grief...

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:45.790
Huh?

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.530
Hiyu?
Huh?

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.360
Is something the matter?

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.760
The strawberry here not good enough for ya?

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.560
I don't think that's it.

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:55.360
Don't talk in unison!

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.830
Everyone, um...

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.610
What is it, man?

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:13.720
Than...

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:24.930
Kanashige ni sukoshi utsumuite

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:29.630
Yatto kimi wa tsubuyaita

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:39.210
Kasuka ni kikoeta no wa seiippai no sayonara

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:46.150
Fushizen na chinmoku no naka

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:50.420
Hibiku bokura no kodou

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:54.790
Mata aeru meguriaou yo

00:22:54.790 --> 00:23:00.600
Sorezore no asu wo sagashi ni deyou yo

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:05.100
Setsunasa ni yasashisa kureta

00:23:05.100 --> 00:23:09.540
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:15.350
Marude sou kono hanabira ga

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.990
Tabidachi wo shukufuku shiteru you sa

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:25.360
Sabishisa wo tsutsunde kureta

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:29.820
Nukumori wasurenai

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:35.730
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:47.610
Aoi?

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:49.240
Misato?

00:23:50.350 --> 00:23:52.720
Oh, yeah, here...

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:56.220
The Self-Defense Force people say
they're driving us out now.

00:23:56.220 --> 00:23:58.820
Oh, okay, I'm coming now.

00:23:58.820 --> 00:24:00.220
Something happen?

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:01.460
Are you all right?

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:03.480
Nothing, I'm fine.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:13.100
THANK YOU
